@startuml selma_cgir_hash_chain
' ============================================================
' Selma — CG-IR Hash Composition & Incremental Reuse
' Source:  SPECIFICATION.md §2.6, §3.5
' C4:      Hermetic Compiler → Compiled Rules Adapter → cgir_store
' Contract: 8.2.4
'
' DETAIL VIEW (Round-02): zoom of Compilation Hash Nodes → Publish.
' Not an independent aggregate — sub-stages of Hermetic Compiler (§2.6).
' Dual-hash model and incremental reuse decision path.
' Canonical linear pipeline remains selma_compilation_pipeline.puml.
' Ownership: README.md
' ============================================================

title Selma — CG-IR Hash Composition (Detail View)\n<size:12><i>Dual-hash model · local node identity · CAS dedup · compiled_at excluded</i></size>

!include ./common/sm_styles.puml

[*] --> NodeBodyLoaded : <b>compilation begins</b>\nactor: System (Hermetic Compiler)\ncommand: load semantic_body + presentation_body\nevent: HashChainStarted

state "Node Body\nLoaded" as NodeBodyLoaded #B9770E : **entry** semantic_body + presentation_body\n**allowed** dual hash compute\n**forbidden** neighbor embedding
state "Semantic Hash\nComputed" as SemanticHashComputed #1B7A6E : **entry** SHA-256(canonical_json(semantic_body))\n**allowed** reuse check\n**forbidden** include presentation fields
state "Presentation Hash\nComputed" as PresentationHashComputed #1B7A6E : **entry** SHA-256(canonical_json(presentation_body))\n**allowed** editorial-only change path\n**forbidden** alter semantic_hash
state "Check Semantic\nReuse" as CheckSemanticReuse #B9770E : **entry** compare prior snapshot node hashes\n**allowed** reuse or recompute branch\n**forbidden** force full rebuild when semantic matches
state "Reuse Semantic\nSubgraph" as ReuseSemantic #2C6E49 : **entry** semantic_hash match\neditorial change only\n**allowed** preserve evaluator subgraph\n**forbidden** recompute pure semantic work
state "Recompute\nEvaluator" as RecomputeEvaluator #1B7A6E : **entry** semantic_hash new or modified\n**allowed** rebuild evaluator materialization
state "Node Hash\nComposed" as NodeHashComposed #3B7DD8 : **entry** SHA-256({semantic_hash, presentation_hash})\n**allowed** local node identity only\n**forbidden** embed graph neighbors
state "Edge Hash\nComputed" as EdgeHashComputed #1B7A6E : **entry** per depends_on:\nSHA-256({source, target})\n**allowed** directional edges
state "Snapshot Hash\nComposed" as SnapshotHashComposed #3B7DD8 : **entry** SHA-256({sorted node_hashes,\nsorted edge_hashes, provenance})\n**forbidden** include compiled_at
state "Check CAS\nExistence" as CheckCAS #B9770E : **entry** lookup cgir_store\n**allowed** dedup or new write
state "Published\n(Dedup)" as PublishedDedup #2C6E49 : **entry** hash exists · no-op **terminal**\n**allowed** return existing hash\n**forbidden** rewrite bytes
state "Published\n(New)" as PublishedNew #2C6E49 : **entry** novel snapshot write-once **terminal**\n**allowed** CAS put\n**forbidden** in-place update

NodeBodyLoaded --> SemanticHashComputed : <b>hash semantic</b>\nactor: System\nevent: SemanticHashComputed
NodeBodyLoaded --> PresentationHashComputed : <b>hash presentation</b>\nactor: System\nevent: PresentationHashComputed

SemanticHashComputed --> CheckSemanticReuse : <b>ready</b>\nactor: System\nevent: SemanticHashReady
PresentationHashComputed --> CheckSemanticReuse : <b>ready</b>\nactor: System\nevent: PresentationHashReady

CheckSemanticReuse --> ReuseSemantic : <b>unchanged semantic_body</b>\nactor: System\nguard: description/editorial edit only\nevent: SemanticSubgraphReused
CheckSemanticReuse --> RecomputeEvaluator : <b>semantic changed or new</b>\nactor: System\nevent: SemanticSubgraphRecomputed

ReuseSemantic --> NodeHashComposed : <b>compose node_hash</b>\nactor: System\nevent: NodeHashComposed
RecomputeEvaluator --> NodeHashComposed : <b>compose node_hash</b>\nactor: System\nevent: NodeHashComposed

NodeHashComposed --> EdgeHashComputed : <b>hash edges</b>\nactor: System\ncommand: for each depends_on\nevent: EdgeHashesComputed
EdgeHashComputed --> SnapshotHashComposed : <b>compose snapshot</b>\nactor: System\nguard: compiled_at EXCLUDED\nevent: SnapshotHashComposed
SnapshotHashComposed --> CheckCAS : <b>CAS lookup</b>\nactor: System\nevent: CasLookupStarted

CheckCAS --> PublishedDedup : <b>identical content</b>\nactor: System\nguard: same hash + frozen_env + engine\nevent: CgIrDedupHit
CheckCAS --> PublishedNew : <b>novel snapshot</b>\nactor: System\nevent: CgIrPublishedNew

PublishedDedup --> [*] : <b>terminal</b>\nactor: System\ncommand: sink\nevent: none
PublishedNew --> [*] : <b>terminal</b>\nactor: System\ncommand: sink\nevent: none

@enduml
